<Layout title='About Me'>
    <h1 style="font-weight: bold;">About Me</h1>
    <p>Hello! My name is Huu Thang Tu (Hữu Thắng Từ), though I usually go by Thang. I was born in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam, and later moved to the United States knowing only basic English. Overcoming that initial language barrier to become fully bilingual in Vietnamese and English has shaped how I approach new challenges—building my adaptability, communication skills, and passion for continuous learning.</p>
    <h2 style="font-weight: bold;">Now</h2>
    <p>Currently, I am a freshman enrolled in the <a href="https://www.cpschools.com/o/cps/page/governors-stem-academy">Governor's STEM Academy</a> at <a href="https://www.cpschools.com/o/gfh">Grassfield High School</a>. Outside of class, I spend my time exploring various areas of computer science and technology—from building software projects to managing community gaming infrastructure.</p>
</Layout>
